//
// Key Principles:
// - Production mode = Equipment ACTIVELY PRODUCING (runTime)
// - Planned downtime = SCHEDULED STOPS (maintenance, breaks, etc.)
// - Unplanned downtime = UNSCHEDULED STOPS (faults, breakdowns, etc.)
